{"id": "benefits-administrator-ten-year-review", "title": "A benefits contract passed ten years before supervisors reviewed it", "seconds": 49.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "6246bc25bd150c38", "words": 111, "beats": [{"scene": "c", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Five vendors competed to administer San Francisco employee benefits.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.39, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["When", "did", "the", "contract", "start?"], "sub": "San Francisco employee benefits"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.9, 1.3, 1.42, 2.04, 2.31, 2.95, 3.56]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The winning contract started in March. Some services began in July.", "t0": 4.51, "t1": 8.7, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "original", "kicker": "Contract term", "text": "March 1, 2015", "mark": "March"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.47, 1.07, 1.46, 1.57, 2.49, 2.73, 3.25, 3.59, 3.69]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "That four-month difference mattered when the contract reached ten years.", "t0": 8.82, "t1": 13.1, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "10 years", "label": "Board review threshold"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.95, 1.44, 2.17, 2.41, 2.52, 3.1, 3.45, 3.75]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The ninth amendment took the agreement past the threshold.", "t0": 13.22, "t1": 16.2, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "amend9", "kicker": "Signed ninth amendment", "text": "June 30, 2025", "mark": "June"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.48, 0.94, 1.21, 1.34, 1.81, 2.23, 2.37]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Analysts found the department missed required Board approval.", "t0": 16.42, "t1": 20.14, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "bla", "kicker": "Budget and Legislative Analyst", "text": "Board approval", "mark": "approval"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.54, 0.86, 0.98, 1.56, 2.42, 2.99, 3.23]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Supervisors later approved the tenth amendment and a $555,000 increase.", "t0": 20.26, "t1": 27.01, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$555,000", "label": "Contract increase"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.88, 1.21, 1.73, 1.85, 2.12, 2.71, 3.1, 3.24, 3.63, 4.06, 4.76, 5.22, 6.0]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The department reported that the vendor met every performance guarantee.", "t0": 27.13, "t1": 31.11, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "bla", "kicker": "Department performance report", "text": "Performance guarantees", "mark": "guarantees"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.6, 1.09, 1.24, 1.38, 1.76, 2.07, 2.54, 3.17]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The new solicitation capped the full term at ten years.", "t0": 31.33, "t1": 34.82, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "new-procurement", "kicker": "Replacement solicitation", "text": "Total term of ten years", "mark": "ten years"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.34, 1.15, 1.5, 1.67, 2.08, 2.47, 2.61, 2.94]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Four firms submitted proposals. Two qualified as responsive.", "t0": 34.94, "t1": 39.28, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "4 proposals", "label": "2 responsive bids"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.84, 1.28, 2.42, 2.86, 3.47, 3.62]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Health Service Board voted unanimously to retain the incumbent through 2031.", "t0": 39.4, "t1": 45.3, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "selection-minutes", "kicker": "Approved board minutes", "text": "January 2027 through December 2031", "mark": "2031"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.55, 0.99, 1.32, 1.66, 2.94, 3.14, 3.6, 3.73, 4.53, 4.83, 5.18]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 45.42, "t1": 48.05, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.92, 1.11, 1.41, 1.49, 1.6, 1.86, 2.17]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"c": "The contract date", "r": "The missed review", "o": "The next competition"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "person"}